Exception // source-derived network specimen

The network.forward-backward specimen of the Layered networks pattern is an
independently rendered composition based on the topology, notation and
equations of Figure 1c-d in:

  Yann LeCun, Yoshua Bengio and Geoffrey Hinton, "Deep learning",
  Nature 521, 436-444 (2015). https://doi.org/10.1038/nature14539

The original published figure artwork is not included. The specimen's data,
wherever it appears, is excluded from the Apache License 2.0 grant above:

  - its entry in
    patterns/diagram-static-network/diagram-static-network.source.js, and the
    forward and backward equation sets that entry uses, in the same file;
  - the restatement of its connections and marks in
    tests/network-contract.test.mjs;
  - every rendering or export of the specimen.

No license to the underlying source material is granted. The rest of the
